{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1220432001:0":{"text":"你还好吧，小姑娘？别怕，你哥哥已经把坏人都打跑了。","source_cn":"你还好吧，小姑娘？别怕，你哥哥已经把坏人都打跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x367A94186325A888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220432002:0":{"text":"嗯……我、我没事。我哥哥是最厉害的拳击手！","source_cn":"嗯……我、我没事。我哥哥是最厉害的拳击手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D50C1EDFCF2E88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220432003:0":{"text":"温蒂，你没事就太好了！卢卡先生，谢谢你……","source_cn":"温蒂，你没事就太好了！卢卡先生，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x923ACF1F0F37E69E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220432004:0":{"text":"小子，这件事结束前，你妹妹就住在我们血薇帮的地方了。","source_cn":"小子，这件事结束前，你妹妹就住在我们血薇帮的地方了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEF2C1916E1D337F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220432005:0":{"text":"啊？可是……","source_cn":"啊？可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x114E05AE8A932658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220432006:0":{"text":"没有可是，我来保证她的安全。你全力准备下一场拳赛，要赢。","source_cn":"没有可是，我来保证她的安全。你全力准备下一场拳赛，要赢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74BBDC663B470C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220432007:0":{"text":"可我已经没希望了，谁会愿意签约一个打假拳的职业拳手呢？","source_cn":"可我已经没希望了，谁会愿意签约一个打假拳的职业拳手呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB31083D98F14AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220432008:0":{"text":"那可不一定。","source_cn":"那可不一定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F1DB85029BD5D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220432009:0":{"text":"小子，之前你说，有个耀光来的拳击掮客想招你。他在哪儿？","source_cn":"小子，之前你说，有个耀光来的拳击掮客想招你。他在哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E8781A4DE9330F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220432010:0":{"text":"他？我只知道他经常在<style=\"highlight\">广场区</style>附近出没。","source_cn":"他？我只知道他经常在<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE96A27BD30728F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220432011:0":{"text":"卢卡先生，你想做什么？","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你想做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F051